Annual Progress Report
Since April 2025, the following actions were completed:

Results of structures assessed from 2022-2024 were reviewed by the Office of the Wet-suwet’en and decisions made on next steps for each structure;
Training was provided to Office of the Wet’suwet’en field technicians in barrier assessments, habitat confirmations, and electrofisher use;
Owners were identified and contacted for 2 priority barriers;
SSAF indicator ratings were incorporated into structure rankings, and
The connectivity models was updated based on the above actions, and outputs were incorporated into this WCRP.
